## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates practical testing strategies for feature flag systems in production environments, focusing on safety, reliability, and observability during A/B testing rollouts.

## Key Concepts

- Feature flag evaluation logic
- API contract testing
- User segmentation and targeting
- Rollout percentage management
- CI/CD safety nets and rollback procedures
- Metrics collection and monitoring
- Mobile client compatibility

## Code Example

```javascript
// Simple flag evaluation with user targeting
function shouldShowFeature(user, flag) {
  if (!flag.enabled) return false;

  // Check user targeting rules
  if (flag.targetUsers && !flag.targetUsers.includes(user.id)) {
    return false;
  }

  // Apply rollout percentage
  const hash = simpleHash(user.id + flag.name);
  return (hash % 100) < flag.rolloutPercent;
}
```

